{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52245","headline":"诗（幷序） 六 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他家笑吾贫，吾贫（五贫）极快乐。\n无牛亦无马，不愁贼（一作「贱」）抄掠。\n你富户役高，差（一作「羞」）科并用却。\n吾无呼唤处，饱吃长展脚。\n你富披锦袍，寻常被纒缚。\n穷苦无烦恼，草衣随体着。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}